So, RNG providing, I think I may have my first ascendable character.
Although it's fairly early in the game, things are going remarkably
well. Some of the highlights of my inventory are a +2 blessed SDSM, a
+2 Boots of Speed, +2 CoMR and +2 Gauntlets of Power. While zap-testing
an early wand it turned out to be WoW. I was overjoyed to say the
least, as I can count the amount of wishes i've ever gotten in my
entire nethack career on one hand.

But, I digress. On to the point. After finding the wand and wishing up
the gear I mentioned, I went to convert the altar in the mines. This
alarmed the guards. Incidentally, I wasn't aware that the guards took
notice of this, although it does seem to make sense. Thinking quickly,
I decided to wish for a blessed figurine of an archon so as to not take
alignment hits for killing the guards myself. [Not to mention a bit of
loot from the shopkeepers.] I managed to make the best of it with a
magic whistle, and the archon served me well until the Rogue level.
Unfortunately, I was unable to find the stairs down and was forced to
dig. By the time i'd fought through the level below, and found the
stairs, the archon had gone peaceful.

Since my AC is only -16, I doubt that i'll be able to slay it when it
goes feral. Should I continue diving, in the hopes of finding something
that will allow me to kill it? [Such as a wand of death] Conversely, I
have an additional wand of wishing [and a blessed scrolls of charging]
that would allow me to wish up a WoD OR a scroll of taming. However, I
am still lacking several useful things, such as a BoH and AoLS. What
shall I do?

Should I even stray this deep before completing my quest? I'm currently
level 12, so I have a bit more experience to go.

Any other advice that would help me survive would be greatly
appreciated. I do not really expect to ascend this character, but i'll
give it my best, as always. The deepest I have ever managed to dive was
to a Labyrinth-esque level, where a master lich quickly summoned a
horde of minotaurs and dragons that slew me readily. Is this Gehennom?
Either way, I hope to make a much better showing of myself this time.

